    {
      "id": "claim_bf7ac5dbd5914600a9f000cc6dcc0df8",
      "statement": "The canonical user loop is import-dats (creating the system) -> import-roms (matching and placing files in the system's base directory) -> sort-roms (distributing files across the system directory, 1G1R and Trash); a system must already exist in the database for ROMs to match, and sorting requires at least one region configured in REGIONS_ALL or REGIONS_ONE.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://README.md#L217-L226",
