      "id": "claim_eb3fba0a54ae44cfb73c624bca8743bf",
      "statement": "On startup main.rs resolves a data directory (OXYROMON_DATA_DIRECTORY, else the platform data dir plus `oxyromon`), creates the directory and `oxyromon.db` if missing, and opens the pool, which applies the compile-time embedded sqlx migrations automatically; README still documents the override as OXYROMON_DATA_DIR, which the code does not read.",
