    {
      "id": "claim_43a6c70ca42040909117ed3f03d25a65",
      "statement": "ROM_DIRECTORY (default ~/Emulation) and TMP_DIRECTORY (default system temp dir) are ordinary settings rows seeded lazily on first read from OXYROMON_ROM_DIRECTORY / OXYROMON_TMP_DIRECTORY or the platform default and then persisted, so subsequent changes belong in the database rather than the environment; main.rs reads both at startup to guarantee they are initialized.",
